    - 1.6) [OpenTTD directories](#16-openttd-directories)
    - 1.7) [Compiling OpenTTD](#17-compiling-openttd)
- 2.0) [Contact and community](#20-contact-and-community)
    - 2.1) [Multiplayer games](#21-multiplayer-games)
