ions can serve industries with attached neutral stations: �OWhen enabled, industries with attached stations (such as Oil Rigs) may also be served by company-owned stations built nearby. When disabled, these industries may only be served by their attached stations. Any nearby company stations won't be able to serve them, nor will the attached station serve anything else other than the industryqالسماح بحذف اكثر من الطرق المملوكة للمدينة و الجسور و غيرها: @Make it easier to remove town-owned infrastructure and buildingsMaximum length of trains:  Set the maximum length of trains tile␀␀/كمية دخان/شرار القطارات:Oحدد مقدار الدخان أو عدد الشرارت من المركبات+موديل تسارع القطارات: ��Select the physics model for train acceleration. The "original" model penalises slopes equally for all vehicles. The "realistic" model penalises slopes and curves depending on various properties of the consist, like length and tractive effort.نمط تسارع عربات الطريق: ��Select the physics model for road vehicle acceleration. The "original" model penalises slopes equally for all vehicles. The "realistic" model penalises slopes depending on various properties of the engine, for example 'tractive effort'Slope steepness for trains: \Steepness of a sloped tile for a train. Higher values make it more difficult to climb a hill%&Slope steepness for road vehicles: cSteepness of a sloped tile for a road vehicle. Higher values make it more difficult to climb a hill_منع القطارات والسفن من الدوران بزاوية تسعين درجة : ��90 degree turns occur when a horizontal track is directly followed by a vertical track piece on the adjacent tile, thus making the train turn by 90 degree when traversing the tile edge instead of the usual 45 degrees for other track combinationsBالسماح بربط محطتين غير متجاورتين : zAllow adding parts to a station without directly touching the existing parts, by Ctrl+Clicking while placing the new partsالتضخم: �تمكين التضخم في الاقتصاد ، حيث ترتفع التكاليف بشكل أسرع قليلاً من ال