: �LSelect the timekeeping units of the game. This cannot be changed later.

Calendar-based is the classic OpenTTD experience, with a year consisting of 12 months, and each month having 28-31 days.

In Wallclock-based time, cargo production and financials are instead based on one-minute increments, which is about as long as a 30 day month takes in Calendar-based mode. These are grouped into 12-minute periods, equivalent to a year in Calendar-based mode.

In either mode there is always a classic calendar, which is used for introduction dates of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructureCalendar	WallclockMinutes per year: �~Choose the number of minutes in a calendar year. The default is 12 minutes. Set to 0 to stop calendar time from changing. Increasing the length of the calendar year slows down the introduction of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructure. It does not affect vehicle speed or economic simulation, except for inflation. This setting is only available when using wallclock timekeeping0 (calendar time frozen) Scale town cargo production: 6Scale the cargo production of towns by this percentage$Scale industry cargo production: ;Scale the cargo production of industries by this percentage%8Ibilgailu bat zahartzen denean automatikoki berritu: �Gaitua dagoenean, Ibilgailuek bere lan-bizitza amaitzear dutenean eta beharrezko baldintzak betetzen badira automatikoki berrituko dira6Ibilgailuak automatikoki berritu bere adina  deneanRIbilgailu bat atomatikoki berritzeko kontuan hartu behar den urte kopuru erlatiboa hilabete lehenago hilabete beranduago7Ibilgailuak berritzeko behar den gutxienezko dirua: dBankuan gutxienez eduki beharko den diru kopurua ibilgailuen berritze automatikoa erabiltzen hastekoAkats mezuen iraupena: ��Lehio gorrian agertzen diren akats mezuen iraupena automatikoki itxi baino lehen. Kontuan hartu zeinbait akats mezu (Kritikoak) ez direla automatikoki itxiko ezarritako denbora pasa eta gero, eskuz itxi behako diraErakutsi argibideak: �Sagua, interfazeko elementu batzuen gainean jartzerakoan, argibideak bistaratu aurretik pasa beharko den denbora. Elementu batzuetan saguko eskuineko botoia sakatu beharko da&Sagua gainean mantendu milisegundu Klikatu eskuineko botoiarekin?Herriaren bistanleria herriaren izen kartelan ikusgai izan: :Herriaren bistanleria herriaren izen kartelan ikusgai izanMarren lodiera grafikoetan: �Grafikoen marren lodiera. Marra fina irakurtzeko er