Calendar-based is the classic OpenTTD experience, with a year consisting of 12 months, and each month having 28-31 days.

In Wallclock-based time, cargo production and financials are instead based on one-minute increments, which is about as long as a 30 day month takes in Calendar-based mode. These are grouped into 12-minute periods, equivalent to a year in Calendar-based mode.

In either mode there is always a classic calendar, which is used for introduction dates of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructureCalendar	WallclockMinutes per year: �~Choose the number of minutes in a calendar year. The default is 12 minutes. Set to 0 to stop calendar time from changing. Increasing the length of the calendar year slows down the introduction of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructure. It does not affect vehicle speed or economic simulation, except for inflation. This setting is only available when using wallclock timekeeping0 (calendar time frozen) Scale town cargo production: 6Scale the cargo production of towns by this percentage$Scale industry cargo production: ;Scale the cargo production of industries by this percentage%'Ferfang âlde fiertugen automatysk: TBy ynskeakeljen wurden fiertugen dy't hast op harren ein binne automatyske ferfongen9Ferfang in fiertúch automatysk nei  maksimale âldensGLeeftiid wêrop in fiertúch yn oanmerking komt foar automatysk fernije moanne fan te foaren moannen letter5Minimumbedrach benedicht foar automatysk fernije: ^Bedrach wat oerbliuwe moat foardat der oer neitocht wurdt in fiertúch automatysk te ferfangenDoer flatermeldings: RDoer fan reade flatermeldings. Guon krityske flater wurde net automatysk ôfslutenArktips sjen litte: �Tiid wernei arktips sjen litten wurde at jo de mûs de boppe hâlde. Arktips kinne ek oan de rjochtermûsknop bûn wurde asto dizze wearde op 0 set$Sweve foar  milliseconde␀␀␀sRjochtsklikje%Ynwennertal sjen litte by steden: 3Lit it ynwennteral fan steden in harren labels sjenGroute fan grafyklijnen: eWidens dan de linen yn de grafiken. Tinne linen binne presyser, groutere linen binne makliker te sjen7Show the NewGRF's name in the build vehicle window: \Add a line to the build vehicle window, showing which NewGRF the selected vehicle comes from@Show the cargoes the vehicles can carry in the list windows: VIf enabled, the vehicle's transportable load will appea