cks, 'last available' selects the newest type of tracks, and 'most used' selects the type which is currently most in useYang tersedia terawalYang tersedia sebelumnyaYang selalu digunakan%Tunjukkan landasan yang ditempah: mGive reserved tracks a different colour to assist in problems with trains refusing to enter path-based blocks.Alat binaan tetap aktif selepas digunakan: FSimpan alat pembinaan untuk jambatan, terowong, dll. buka selepas guna:Automatically remove signals during rail construction: �Automatically remove signals during rail construction if the signals are in the way. Note that this can potentially lead to train crashesFast forward speed limit: ��Limit on how fast the game goes when fast forward is enabled. 0 = no limit (as fast as your computer allows). Values below 100% slow the game down. The upper-limit depends on the specification of your computer and can vary depending on the game% normal game speed*No limit (as fast as your computer allows)News ticker: 'Play sound for summarised news messagesNewspaper: %Play sound upon display of newspapersEnd of year: End of period: sPlay sound at the end of a year summarising the company's performance during the year compared to the previous yearyPlay sound at the end of a period summarising the company's performance during the period compared to the previous periodPembinaan: 7Play sound on successful constructions or other actionsButton clicks: Beep when clicking buttonsDisasters/accidents: -Play sound effects of accidents and disastersVehicles: Play sound effects of vehiclesAmbient: 6Play ambient sounds of landscape, industries and towns.Amaun maksimum kereta api setiap syarikat: 0Maximum number of trains that a company can have7Amaun maksimum kenderaan jalanraya setiap syarikat: 1Jumlah maksimum kenderaan darat sesebuah syarikat+Amaun maksimum pesawat setiap syarikat: 2Maximum number of aircraft that a company can have)Amaun maksimum kapal setiap syarikat: /Maximum number of ships that a company can have$Nafikan keretapi untuk komputer: LEnabling this setting makes building trains impossible for a computer player/Nafikan kenderaan jalanraya untuk komputer: SEnabling this setting makes building road vehicles impossible for a computer player#Nafikan pesawat untuk komputer: NEnabling this setting makes building aircraft impossible for a computer player!Nafikan kapal untuk komputer: KEnabling this setting makes building ships impossible for a computer player@Benarkan Kepintaran Tiruan dalam permainan pemain berbilang: 9Benarkan AI komputer menyertai permainan berbilang pemain,#opcodes sebelum skrip adalah digantung: FMaximum number of computation steps that a script can take in one turn Max memory usage per script: yHow much memory a single script may consume before it's forcibly terminated. This may need to be increased for large maps MiB(Tempoh waktu servis dalam peratusan: �Pilih sama ada selenggara kenderaan dimulakan sejak tempoh masa dari servis terakhir atau apabila peratusan kebolehupayaan kenderaan berkurang kepada peratusan tertentu.(Default service interval for trains: nSet the default service interval for new rail vehicles, if no explicit service interval is set for the vehicle/Default service interval for road vehicles: nSet the default service interval for new road vehicles, if no explicit service interval is set for the vehicle*Default service interval for aircraft: �Tetapkan selang masa servis untuk pesawat baru kepada tetapan asal jika tiada selang masa servis yang jelas ditetapkan untuk pesawat tersebut'Default service interval for ships: �Tetapkan selang masa servis untuk kapal baru kepada tetapan asal jika tiada selang masa servis yang jelas ditetapkan untuk kapal tersebut Day␀␀␀s Minute␀␀␀s %DilumpuhkanPServis tidak diperlukan apabila kerosakan kenderaan ditetapkan kepada tiada: DWhen enabled, vehicles do not get serviced if they cannot break downFLoading speed penalty for trains that are longer than the station: �When enabled, trains which are too long for the station load more slowly than a train which fits the station. This setting does not affect pathfinding(Benarkan had kelajuan untuk gerabak: WWhen enabled, also use speed limits of wagons for deciding the maximum speed of a trainTiada landasan elektrik: gEnabling this setting disables the requirement to electrify tracks to make electric engines run on them(Ketibaan kenderaan di stesen pemain: LDisplay a newspaper when the first vehicle arrives at a new player's station)Ketibaan kenderaan di stesen pesaing: PDisplay a newspaper when the first vehicle arrives at a new competitor's stationKemalangan / bencana: 5Display a newspaper when accidents or disasters occur'Accidents of competitor's vehicles: :Display a newspaper about crashed vehicles for competitorsMaklumat syarikat: gPaparkan surat khabar mengenai pembukaan syarikat baru, atau apabila syarikat dalam risiko untuk muflisPembukaan industri: ,Display a newspaper when new industries openPenutupan industri: 9Paparkan keratan akhbar apabila ada industri yang ditutupPerubahan ekonomi: 3Display a newspaper about global changes to economyHPerubahan pengeluaran industri-industri yang diservis oleh syarikat: cDisplay a newspaper when the production level of industries change, which are served by the companyGPerubahan pengeluaran industri-industri yang diservis oleh pesaing: gPaparkan keratan akhbar apabila berlaku perubahan tahap pengeluaran industri yang diservis oleh pesaing)Pengubaran pengeluaran industri lain: vDisplay a newspaper when the production level of industries change, which are not served by the company or competitors2Nasihat / maklumat tentang kenderaan syarikat: 1Display messages about vehicles needing attentionKenderaan baru: =Display a newspaper when a new vehicle type becomes available$Penukaran pada penerimaan kargo: WTunjukkan mesej berkenaan perubahan kebolehterimaan sesetengah kargo di stesen terlibatSub