Āhua ponoMauīPokapūMatau hēkenaMoni mutunga kore: 0Tangohia te tepe hokohoko, kāore e taea te mone)Moni taurewa mōrahi i te tīmatanga: �Te tatau mōrahi ka taea te piki ai e ia umanga (kāore e whaiwhakaarotia te pikiutu tukupū). Mehemea ka tautuhitia ki te "Kāore he moni taurewa", kāore he moni e wātea mehemea kāore hoki i whakaratoa e tētahi hōtuhi kēmu, e te tautuhinga "Moni mutunga kore" rāneiKāore he moni taurewaPāpātanga huamoni: \Pāpātanga huamoni o te moni taurewa; ka tautuhitia hoki te pikiutu tukupū, mehemea ka kāUtu whakahaere: STautuhitia te kōeke tautiaki me ngā utu whakahaere mō ngā waka me te tūāhangaItiWawaengaNuiTere o te hanga: =Whakatinaia ngā mahi hangahanga a ngā kaitākaro hangahanga!Turingongengonge o ngā waka: ITautuhitia te auau o ngā turingongengonge o ngā waka kāore e tapia ana%Tau whakarea o te pūtea āwhina: 2Tautuhitia te utu o ngā hononga e pīrangitia anaWā o te pūtea āwhina: ETautuhitia te tatau o ngā tau ka whakawhiwhia ai ngā pūtea āwhinaETautuhitia te tatau o ngā wā ka whakawhiwhia ai ngā pūtea āwhinaKāore he pūtea āwhinaUtu hangahanga: ;Tautuhitia te kōeke o ngā utu hangahanga me ngā utu hokoItiWawaengaNuiAuheke ohaoha: �Ina kā, ka taea te tūpono e ngā auheke i ētahi wā. I te auheke, ka iti rawa atu te whakaputa katoa (ka hoki ki te kōeke o mua i te mutunga o te auheke)BĀraia ngā tereina kei haere whakamuri i roto i ngā teihana: �Ina kā, kāore ngā tereina e haere whakamuri i roto i ngā teihana ehara i te momo whakamutunga, kāore hoki ina poto ake te ara ki te ūnga mehemea ka haere whakamuriMaikiroa: \Hohokona ngā maikiroa ka ārai pea, whakangaro pea rānei i ngā waka, te tūāhanga rānei'Waiaro o ngā kāwanatanga ā rohe: ~Kōwhiria me pēwhea te pā a te turituri me te pakaru taiao ki tō hau, ki tō āhei hoki ki te hanga tonu i roto i te tāoneTepe teitei mahere: uTautuhitia te teitei mōrahi o te whenua o te mahere. (aunoa): ka kōwhiria he uara pai i muri i te hanga i te whenua(aunoa)gTē taea te tautuhi te tepe teitei mahere ki tēnei uara. He teitei atu tētahi maunga kei te mahereJTukuna kia hanga whenua i raro i ngā whare, ngā ara, te mea, te mea: MTukuna kia hanga whenua i raro i ngā whare me ngā ara ki te kore e tangohia7Tukuna kia pono atu ngā rahi o ngā rohe hopuhopu: GMe rerekē ngā rahi o ngā rohe hopuhopu mō ngā momo teihana rerekē[Ka whakarato ngā teihana o te umanga i ngā ahumahi e piri ana ki ētahi teihana ngū: �qIna kā, ka taea te whakarato ngā ahumahi e piri ana ki ētahi teihana (hei tauira, ngā papahinu) e ngā teihana tata kua hangaia e te umanga. Ina poko, ka whakaratoa aua ahumahi e ngā teihana anake e piri rā. Kāore e taea te whakarato e ngā teihana tata o te umanga, kāore hoki te teihana e piri rā e whakarato i tētahi atu mea, ka whakaratoa te ahumahi anakecTukuna kia maha ake ngā rori, ngā arawhiti, me ngā anaroa o tētahi tāone ka taea te tango: JMeinga kia māmā atu te tango i te tūāhanga me ngā whare o ngā tāoneRoa mōrahi o ngā tereina: (Tautuhitia te roa mōrahi o ngā tereina paparikiTatau o te auahi/kora: ITautuhitia te tatau o te auahi, ngā kora rānei kia peia atu e ngā wakaTauira whakahohoro tereina: �Kōwhiria te tauira ahupūngao mō te whakahohoro tereina. Te tauira "taketake": ka ōrite te whiu i ngā rōnaki mō ngā waka katoa. Te tauira "āhua pono": mō te whiu i ngā rōnaki me ngā koki, kei te āhua tonu o ētahi atu āhuatanga, hei tauira, te roa me te kaha kumekume!Tauira whakahohoro waka rori: �Kōwhiria te tauira ahupūngao mō te whakahohoro waka rori. Te tauira "taketake": ka ōrite te whiu i ngā rōnaki mō ngā waka katoa. Te tauira "āhua pono": mō te whiu i ngā rōnaki, kei te āhua tonu o ētahi āhuatanga o te pūkaha, hei tauira, te "kaha kumekume"%Kōeke paripari mō ngā tereina: cTe kōeke paripari o ngā papariki mō ngā tereina. Ka whakauauatia te piki puke e ngā uara nunui%'Kōeke paripari mō ngā waka rori: eTe kōeke paripari o ngā papariki mō ngā waka rori. Ka whakauauatia te piki puke e ngā uara nunui&Āraia ngā tereina kei huri 90°: �Ka huri te tereina ki te 90 tākiri ina whāia tētahi ara huapae e tētahi ara poutū i te papariki pātata, ka huri te tereina ki te 45 tākiri i ngā pūāhua kē:Tukuna kia honoa ngā teihana kāore i te pātata pū: �Tukuna kia tāpiria he wāhi ki tētahi teihana kāore e pā ki ngā wāhi e tū kē ana, mā te Pātaki+Pāwhiri ina whakatakoto i ngā wāhi houPikiutu tukupū: ]Whakakāngia te pikiutu tukupū i te ōhanga, ka piki tere ake ai ngā utu atu i ngā utu maiRoa arawhiti mōrahi: $Te roa mōrahi mō te hanga arawhitiTeitei arawhiti mōrahi: 'Te teitei mōrahi mō te hanga arawhitiRoa anaroa mōrahi: "Te roa mōrahi mō te hanga anaroa3Me pēwhea te hanga ahumahi mātāmua ā ringa: �LMe pēwhea te whakarato moni mō tētahi ahumahi mātāmua. "Kore": tē taea te whakarato moni, "haurapa": ka taea, engari ka tūpono te hanga i tētahi wāhi matapōkere i te mahere, ka mūhore pea hoki, "pērā i ngā ahumahi kē": ka taea te hanga ahumahi e ngā umanga pērā i ngā ahumahi tukatuka i te wāhi e pīrangitia rāKorePērā i ngā ahumahi kēHaurapa-Whenua papatahi i te taha o ngā ahumahi: �Te rahi o te whenua papatahi i te taha o ngā ahumahi. Ka whakatūturu tēnei ka wātea he āputa i te taha o tētahi ahumahi hei hanga i ngā ara, te mea, te mea:Tukuna kia maha ngā ahumahi ōrite ki tētahi tāone: �I te maha o ngā wā, kāore ngā tāone e hiahia ki ētahi ahumahi neke atu i te kotahi mō ia momo. I tēnei tautuhinga, ka tukuna ngā ahumahi kia maha tētahi momo i tētahi tāoneWhakaaria ngā tohu: 2Kōwhiria te taha o te ara kia makaia ai ngā tohuKi te mauīKi te taha e taraiwa aiKi te matau8Whakaaria te matapihi ahumoni i te mutunga o te tau: 8Whakaaria te matapihi ahumoni i te mutunga o te wā: tIna kā, ka puta mai te matapihi ahumoni i te mutunga o ia tau kia āta mātakina ai te tūranga ahumoni o te umangatIna kā, ka puta mai te matapihi ahumoni i te mutunga o ia wā kia āta mātakina ai te tūranga ahumoni o te umanga1I te taunoa, ka "mutunga kore" ngā mahi hou: �#I te maha o ngā wā, ka tū ngā waka ki ia teihana ka whakahipa ai. Ina kā tēnei tautuhinga, ka taraiwa mutunga kore te waka ki ngā teihana katoa i te haerenga. Kia mahara ka tautuhi tēnei i te uara taunoa mō ngā mahi hou. Ka taea te tautuhi anō ia whanonga ahakoa tēnei tautuhingaGI te taunoa, ka mutu ngā mahi hou a ngā tereina i te  o te atamira�`Te wāhi ka tū ai ngā tereina ki te atamira i te taunoa. Ko te "pito tata" te wāhi he tata ki te tomokanga, ko te "pokapū" te pokapū o te atamira, ko te "pito tawhiti" te wāhi he tawhiti atu i te tomokanga. Kia mahara ka tautuhi tēnei i te uara taunoa mō ngā mahi hou. Ka taea te tautuhi anō ia mahi mā te pāwhiri ki te kuputuhi mō te mahi	pito tatapokapūpito tawhiti6Nekehia te tirohanga ina tata te kiore ki te tapa: LIna kā, ka panuku ngā tirohanga ina tata te kiore ki te tapa o te matapihiPoko$Tirohanga matua, mata whārahi anakeTirohanga matuaTirohanga katoa2Tukuna kia whakapatia te kāwanatanga ā rohe: �Tukuna ngā umanga kia tarai ki te whakapati i te kāwanatanga ā rohe. Mehemea ka kitea te whakapati e tētahi matawai, kāore te umanga e āhei te mahi i roto i te tāone mō te ono marama�Tukuna ngā umanga kia tarai ki te whakapati i te kāwanatanga ā rohe. Mehemea ka kitea te whakapati e tētahi matawai, kāore te umanga e āhei te mahi i roto i te tāone mō te ono meneti4Tukuna kia hokona ngā mōtika kawekawe kaupare: �Mehemea ka hoko he umanga i ngā mōtika kawekawe kaupare mō tētahi tāone, kāore ngā teihana o ngā kaiwhakataetae e whiwhi i te utanga (me ngā kaieke) mō te tekau mā rua marama�Mehemea ka hoko he umanga i ngā mōtika kawekawe kaupare mō tētahi tāone, kāore ngā teihana o ngā kaiwhakataetae e whiwhi i te utanga (me ngā kaieke) mō te tekau mā rua meneti-Tukuna kia whakarato moni mō ngā whare: CTukuna ngā umanga kia hoatu moni ki ngā tāone kia hanga whare aiGTukuna kia whakarato moni mō te whakahouhou i ngā rori o te rohe: �Tukuna ngā umanga kia hoatu moni ki ngā tāone kia whakahouhou ai i ngā rori kia auwaha i ngā ratonga rori i roto i te tāone-Tukuna kia hoatu moni ki ngā umanga kē: NTukuna kia whakawhiti moni i waenganui o ngā umanga i te aratau kaitākarorauRTau whakarea o te taumaha o te utanga kia whaihangaia ai ngā tereina taumaha: �Tautuhitia te pānga o te kawe utanga i roto i ngā tereina. Ka whakauaua atu he uara nui ake i te kawe utanga mō ngā tereina, inarā i ngā puke*Tau whakarea o te tere waka rererangi: �Tautuhitia te pānga tere o ngā waka rererangi ki ngā momo waka kē kia whakapaku ai i te tatau o te moniwhiwhi a ngā waka rererangi1 / %Tatau o ngā tuki waka rererangi: �Tautuhitia te tūponotanga o ngā tuki matapōkere a ngā waka rererangi.
* He tūraru tō ngā waka rererangi rahi mō te tuki ina tau ki ngā taunga itiKore*	WhakapakuMāoriMTukuna kia hanga ara whakawhiti rerewhenua i runga i ngā kaiwhakataetae: _Tukuna kia hanga ara whakawhiti rerewhenua i ngā rori, ngā rēra rānei a ngā kaiwhakataetaeLTukuna kia hanga teihana taraiwamai i ngā rori i hangaia e ngā tāone: GTukuna kia hanga teihana taraiwamai i ngā rori i hangaia e ngā tāoneWTukuna kia hanga teihana taraiwamai i ngā rori i hangaia e ngā kaiwakataetae kē: STukuna kia hanga teihana taraiwamai i ngā rori i hangaia e ngā kaiwhakataetae kē@Tē taea te panoni tēnei tautuhinga ina hanga kētia he wakaTautiaki tūāhanga: �Ina kā, ka puta he utu tautiaki mō te tūāhanga. Ka tupu taupū te utu ki te rahi o te whatunga, nō reira, ka pā nuitia ake ngā umanga nui i ngā umanga itiKara tīmata mō te umanga: 'Kōwhiria te kara tīmata mō te umanga)Kara tīmata mātārua mō te umanga: SKōwhiria te kara tīmata mātārua mō te umanga ina whakakāngia e tētahi newGRF0Kāore rawa ngā taunga rererangi e mōnehu: UIna kā, ka wātea āke ake ngā momo taunga rererangi katoa i muri i ana whakaurunga#Whakatūpato ina ngaro he waka: aKeua he karere kia whakatūpatotia koe ina kore ngā waka e āhei te kite tētahi ara ki te ūnga%Arotaketia ngā mahi a ngā waka: �Ina kā, ka mātakina ngā mahi a ngā waka i ētahi wā, ā, ka pūrongotia ētahi raru ariari i tētahi karere mehemea ka kiteaKāo)Āe, engari ehara mō ngā waka e tū rāNgā waka katoa:Whakatūpato ina tōraro te moniwhiwhi a tētahi waka: KIna kā, ka tukuna he karere ina kore he waka i whiwhi moni i roto i te tauKIna kā, ka tukuna he karere ina kore he waka i whiwhi moni i roto i te wā+Whakatūpato ina tawhito haere he waka: 6Ina kā, ka tukuna he karere ina tawhito haere he waka$Kāore rawa ngā waka e mōnehu: RIna kā, ka wātea āke ake ngā tauira katoa o ngā waka i muri i ana whakaurungaTāima: �YTīpakona te waeine tāima o te kēmu. Tē taea te panoni ā muri atu.

Ko te tāima ā maramataka te wheako taketake o OpenTTD, e 12 ngā marama o te tau, e 28 ki te 31 ngā rā o ia marama.

I te tāima ā karaka, ka mahi te whakaputa utanga me te ahumoni ki ngā waeine kotahi meneti, he tata ōrite ai te roa o te marama o te 30 rā i te aratau tāima ā maramataka. Ka whakarōpūtia ēnei ki ngā wā o te 12 meneti, he ōrite ki te tau i te aratau ā maramataka.

Kei ia aratau he maramataka taketake, e whakamahia ana mō ngā rā whakaurunga o ngā waka, ngā whare, me ētahi momo tūāhangaĀ maramataka	Ā karakaMeneti i te tau: ��Kōwhiria te tatau o ngā meneti i te tau o te maramataka. Ko te 12 meneti te taunoa. Tautuhitia ki te 0 kia āraia te tāima o te maramataka kei haere tonu. Ka whakapōturitia te whakauru i ngā waka, ngā whare, me te tūāhanga e te whakaroa i te tau. Kāore e pāngia te tere o ngā waka me te whaihanga ohaoha, hāunga te pikiutu tukupū. Kāore tēnei tautuhinga e wātea mehemea kāore te tāima ā karaka i te whakamahia-0 (kua whakatiotia te tāima o te maramataka)2Whakareatia te whakaputa utanga a ngā tāone: =Whakareatia te whakaputa utanga a ngā tāone ki tēnei ōrau3Whakareatia te whakaputa utanga a ngā ahumahi: >Whakareatia te whakaputa utanga a ngā ahumahi ki tēnei ōrau%$Whakahou waka aunoa ina tawhito: iIna kā, ka whakakapi aunoatia ngā waka e tata ana ki te mutunga o te ora ina taea ngā herenga whakahou:Whakahou waka aunoa i te  i te tatau mōrahi o ngā tau[Te tatau o ngā tau mai i te tau mōrahi me whaiwhakaarotia ai ngā waka kia whakahou aunoa marama i mua marama i muri'Moni mōkito kia whakahou aunoa ai: ]Te tatau mōkito o te moni me noho i te pēke i mua i te whaiwhakaaro kia whakahou waka aunoaWā o ngā karere hapa: �Te roa o te wā mō te whakaari i ngā karere i roto i te matapihi whero. Kia mahara kāore ētahi karere hapa (tino hirahira) e kati aunoatia i muri i taua wā, me kati ā ringa.Whakaaria ngā whakamāramatanga hunahuna: ��Te tōmuri i mua i te whakaari i ngā whakamāramatanga hunahuna ina whakaparo te kiore i runga i tētahi huānga tāhono. Ka here noatia iho ngā whakamāramatanga hunahuna ki te pātene matau o te kiore ina tautuhitia tēnei uara ki te 0 Whakaparo mō te  mirihēkenaPāwhiri matau?Whakaaria ngā taupori o ngā tāone i ngā tapanga tāone: MWhakaaria ngā taupori o ngā tāone i ngā tapanga mō ana ingoa i te mahere.Mātotoru o ngā rārangi i ngā kauwhata: ��Te whānui o ngā rārangi i ngā kauwhata. He māmā ake te rārangi rauangi ki te āta pānui, he māmā ake te rārangi mātotoru ki te kite, he māmā ake hoki ngā kara ki te kite ina mātotoruCWhakaaria te ingoa o te newGRF i roto i te matapihi hanga waka: iTāpirihia he rārangi ki te matapihi hanga waka, e whakaari ana nā tēwhea newGRF te waka kua tīpakona[Whakaaria ngā momo utanga ka taea te kawe e ngā waka i roto i ngā matapihi rārangi: QIna kā, ka puta i runga i te waka te utanga ka taea te kawe i ngā rārangi waka
Taiao: ��Ka tautuhi ngā taiao i ētahi momo kēmu, he rerekē ngā momo utanga, he rerekē ngā herenga kia whakatupu ngā tāone. Heoi anō, ka tukuna ētahi atu kōwhiringa e ētahi newGRF me ētahi hōtuhi kēmuHanga whenua: ��Ka whakamahi te papatono hanga whenua taketake i te kohinga whakairoiro mātāmua, ka whakaputa hanga tūmau i te whenua. Ko TerraGenesis he papatono hanga whenua e whakamahi ana i te heihei pērene, he maha hoki ana tautuhingaTaketakeTerraGenesisMomo whenua: :Kōwhiria te teitei o ngā puke me ngā maunga i te whenuaApiapi ahumahi: JTautuhi kia whia ngā ahumahi i te tīmatanga, i te toenga hoki o te kēmu1Roa mōrahi ki te tapa mō ngā ahumahi Hinu: ��Te tepe mō te tawhiti ki te tapa o te mahere me hangaia ai ngā whare whakapai hinu me ngā papahinu. I ngā mahere moutere, ka whakatūturu tēnei ka tata aua ahumahi ki te takutai. I ngā mahere rahi ake i te 256 papariki, ka whakarahia taua uaraTeitei rohe hukarere: �Kōwhiria te teitei ka tīmata ai te hukarere i te taiao makariri. Ka pā hoki te hukarere ki te hanga ahumahi me ngā herenga kia whakatupu ngā tāone. Ka taea te whakarerekē mā te pūtakatā takiwā anake, ka tātai noatia iho mā te "horahanga hukarere" i te taunoaHorahanga hukarere: �	Kōwhiria te tatau āwhiwhi o te hukarere i te taiao makariri. Ka pā hoki te hukarere ki te hanga ahumahi me ngā herenga kia whakatupu ngā tāone. Ka whakamahia i te wā hanga mahere anake. Tē taea te hukarere i runga i ngā papariki e pātata ana ki te takutai%Horahanga onepū: �Kōwhiria te tatau āwhiwhi o te onepū i te taiao wera. Ka pā hoki te onepū ki te hanga ahumahi me ngā herenga kia whakatupu ngā tāone. Ka whakamahia i te wā hanga mahere anake.%Tuarangaranga o te whenua: �Kōwhiria te hanga me te tatau o ngā puke. He puke whānui kei te whenua mōhanihani, he maha o ngā puke iti kei te whenua tuarangarangaMōhanihani rawaMōhanihaniTuarangarangaTuarangaranga rawaTuari matatini: �Kōwhiri mehemea he maunga, he wāhi papatahi hoki kei te mahere. Ka nui ake te matatini, ka nui ake ngā rerekētanga i te teitei i waenganui o ngā maunga me ngā wāhi papatahiTatau o ngā awa: Kōwhiri kia whia ngā awaHātepe tuari rākau: Kōwhiria te tuari i ngā rākau i te mahere: "Taketake": ka hora ritea ngā rākau, "whakapai": ka whakatōkia i ētahi rōpūKoreTaketakeWhakapaiWaka rori: Kōwhiria te taha me taraiwa aiTaraiwa ki te mauīTaraiwa ki te matauHurihanga mahereteitei: QKōwhiria te ahu me whakahuri ai te ata mahereteitei kia kuhuna ai ki te ao kēmuEhara ā karaka	Ā karaka1Kōeke teitei mō te mahere takiwā papatahi: PEhara i te hemahema te papariki kotahi, neke atu rānei, i te tapa ki te rakiLEhara i te wai te papariki kotahi, neke atu rānei, i tētahi o ngā tapa%Horahanga mōrahi o ngā teihana: |Te horahanga mōrahi ka taea ai te hora ngā wāhi o tētahi teihana. Kia mahara ka whakapōturitia te kēmu e ngā uara nuiATapi aunoatia ngā waka topatopa i ngā taunga waka topatopa: RTapia ngā waka topatopa i ia taunga, mehemea kāore hoki he taupuni kei te taunga^Honoa te paeutauta hanga whenua ki ngā paeutauta rerewhenua/rori/arawai/taunga rererangi: lIna huakina he paeutauta tūāhanga mō tētahi momo kawekawe, huakina hoki te paeutauta mō te hanga whenuaKara whenua i te mahereiti: 3Te kara o te whenua e whakamahia ana i te mahereiti
