Hei tauira, mehemea 90% te horopū mōrahi o tētahi waka, ā, 20% te wā kia tapi ai, ka tarai te waka kia tapia ina taea te 72% o te horopū'Wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā tereina: wTautuhitia te wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā waka rerewhenua hou, mehemea kāore he wā mataaho i te tautuhitia mō te waka)Wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā waka rori: qTautuhitia te wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā waka rori hou, mehemea kāore he wā mataaho i te tautuhitia mō te waka.Wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā waka rererangi: vTautuhitia te wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā waka rererangi hou, mehemea kāore he wā mataaho i te tautuhitia mō te waka'Wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā kaipuke: oTautuhitia te wā taunoa kia tapi i ngā kaipuke hou, mehemea kāore he wā mataaho i te tautuhitia mō te waka Rā Meneti %	Tē āheiHĀraia te tapi waka ina tautuhitia ngā turingongengonge ki te kore: FIna kā, kāore ngā waka e tapia mehemea tē taea te turingongengongeEWhiu mō te tere utauta mō ngā tereina he roa ake i te teihana: �Ina kā, ka pōturi ake te uta i ngā tereina he roa rawa mō te teihana i te uta i ngā tereina e ō ana ki te teihana. Kāore tēnei tautuhinga e pā ki te kimi ara'Whakakāngia ngā tepetere wākena: \Ina kā, whakamahia ngā tepetere o ngā wākena hei whakatau i te tere mōrahi o te tereina%Kaua ngā rēra hiko e hiahiatia: JIna kā, kāore te whakahiko ara e hiahiatia kia rere ai ngā tereina hiko;Taenga o te waka tuatahi ki te teihana o te kaitākaro: JWhakaaria he nūpepa ina tae te waka tuatahi ki te teihana o te kaitākaroCTaenga o te waka tuatahi ki ngā teihana o ngā kaiwhakataetae: RWhakaaria he nūpepa ina tae te waka tuatahi ki ngā teihana o ngā kaiwhakataetaeMaikiroa: ,Whakaaria he nūpepa ina tūpono he maikiroa:Maikiroa e pā ana ki ngā waka o ngā kaiwhakataetae: AWhakaaria he nūpepa mō ngā waka o ngā kaiwhakataetae kua tukiPārongo umanga: DWhakaaria he nūpepa ina tīmata he umanga hou, ina tata mone rānei%Whakatuwheratanga o ngā ahumahi: 9Whakaaria he nūpepa ina whakatuwheratia ngā ahumahi houKati o ngā ahumahi: +Whakaaria he nūpepa ina katia ngā ahumahiPanoni ōhanga: 3Whakaaria ngā nūpepa mō ngā panoni i te ōhangaAPanoni whakaputa o ngā ahumahi e whakaratoa ana e te umanga: aWhakaaria he nūpepa ina panoni ngā kōeke whakaputa o ngā ahumahi e whakaratoa ana e te umangaKPanoni whakaputa o ngā ahumahi e whakaratoa ana e ngā kaiwhakataetae: kWhakaaria he nūpepa ina panoni ngā kōeke whakaputa o ngā ahumahi e whakaratoa ana e ngā kaiwhakataetae(Panoni whakaputa kē o ngā ahumahi: �Whakaaria he nūpepa ina panoni ngā kōeke whakaputa o ngā ahumahi kāore i te whakaratoa e te umanga, ngā kaiwhakataetae rānei6Kōrero tohu / pārongo mō ngā waka o te umanga: <Whakaaria ngā karere mō te hiahia a ngā waka ki te arongaWaka hou: +Whakaaria he nūpepa ina wātea he waka hou*Panoni i te āhei ki te whiwhi utanga: `Whakaaria ngā karere mō te panoni a ngā teihana i ana āhei ki te whiwhi i ētahi momo utangaPūtea āwhina: IWhakaaria ngā nūpepa mō ngā takamahi e pā ana ki ngā pūtea āwhinaPārongo whānui: �Whakaaria ngā nūpepa mō ngā takamahi whānui, hei tauira, te hokonga o ngā mōtika kaupare, te whakahounga o ngā rori rāneiPokoWhakarāpopotoKatoa'Ka puta ngā nūpepa karakara i te: gTe tau me tāia ai ngā pānui nūpepa ki te kara. I mua i taua tau, ka whakamahia te taetahi pango/māTau tīmata: ,Tau whakamutunga mō te tatau whiwhinga: �Te tau me mutu ai te tatau whiwhinga a te kēmu. I te mutunga o taua tau, ka hopukina te tatau o te umanga, ā, ka whakaaria te mata tauteitei, engari ka taea te tākaro tonu i muri i tērā.
Mehemea i mua tēnei i te tau tīmata, kāore rawa te mata tauteitei e whakaariaKāore rawaMomo ōhanga: ��Ōhanga Mōhanihani: ka putuputu, ka iti hoki ngā panoni whakaputa. Ōhanga Whakatio: ka mutu ngā panoni whakaputa me ngā kati ahumahi. Kāore pea he hua a tēnei tautuhinga mehemea ka whakaratoa ētahi momo ahumahi e tētahi newGRF.

Ka panoni tonu te āhua o te whakaputa ahumahi i ia marama i te ōhanga Whakatio, i te mea ka keua te whakaputa i ētahi wā tūmau kāore i te tukutahitia ki te marama��Ōhanga Mōhanihani: ka putuputu, ka iti hoki ngā panoni whakaputa. Ōhanga Whakatio: ka mutu ngā panoni whakaputa me ngā kati ahumahi. Kāore pea he hua a tēnei tautuhinga mehemea ka whakaratoa ētahi momo ahumahi e tētahi newGRF.

Ka panoni tonu te āhua o te whakaputa ahumahi i ia meneti i te ōhanga Whakatio, i te mea ka keua te whakaputa i ētahi wā tūmau kāore i te tukutahitia ki te menetiTaketakeMōhanihaniWhakatio>Ōrau o te monihua hei utu i roto i ngā pūnaha whāngai: wTe ōrau o te moniwhiwhi hei hoatu ki ngā wāhi i roto i ngā pūnaha whāngai, kia whakahaere pai ake i te moniwhiwhiIna tō, maka tohu ki ia: �Tautuhitia te āputa me hanga tohu ai i te ara tae noa ki tētahi ārai (tētahi atu tohu, he pūtahitanga), ina tōia ngā tohu papariki9Ina tō, me tūmau te āputa i waenganui o ngā tohu: �)Tīpakona me pēwhea te whakatakotoranga tohu ina Pātaki+Tōia ngā tohu. Ina poko, ka makaia ngā tohu ki ngā putanga o ngā anaroa me ngā arawhiti kia karo ai i ngā ara roa ki te kore tohu. Ina kā, ka makaia ngā tohu ki ia papariki T, kia whakamāmā te tīaroaro tohu i ngā ara whakarara-Hanga aunoatia ngā tohu haki i mua i te: �Tautuhitia te tau me whakamahia ai ngā tohu hiko mō ngā ara. I mua i taua tau, ka whakamahia ngā tohu hiko kore (ōrite pū te mahi, engari rerekē te āhua) Whakahurihia ngā momo tohu: uTīpakona te rōpū momo tohu hei whakahuri ina Pātaki+Pāwhiri ki tētahi tohu kua hanga kētia ki te taputapu tohuRōpū onāianei anake	Ari katoaWhakaaria ngā momo tohu: ?Kōwhiria ngā momo tohu me whakaari i roto i te paeutauta tohuTohu ara anake
Tohu katoa)Takotoranga rori mō ngā tāone hou: 3Te takotoranga mō ngā whatunga rori o ngā tāoneTaketakeRori pai akeTukutuku 2x2Tukutuku 3x3Matapōkere&Tukuna ngā tāone kia hanga rori: mTukuna ngā tāone kia hanga rori kia tupu ai. Whakapokoa kia āraia ngā kāwanatanga ā rohe kei hanga rori;Tukuna ngā tāone kia hanga ara whakawhiti rerewhenua: AIna kā, ka taea e ngā tāone te hanga ara whakawhiti rerewhenuahWhaiwhakaarotia te kōeke o te turituri ina whakatina i te whakatakotoranga o ngā taunga rererangi: �XTukuna ngā tāone kia ārai i te hanga taunga rererangi ina kaha te turituri, ka whaiwakaarotia hoki te taupori o te tāone me te rahi me te tawhiti o te taunga rererangi. Ina poko tēnei tautuhinga, ka tuku ngā tāone kia rua anake ngā taunga rererangi mehemea kāore te waiaro o te kāwanatanga ā rohe i te tautuhtia ki te "Tino ngāwari"&Whakatū tāone i roto i te kēmu: JIna āhei, ka tukuna ngā kaitākaro kia whakatū tāone i roto i te kēmu	Tē āheiĀheiĀhei, whakatakotoranga whaiaroMakaia ia whare: VIna āhei, ka tukuna ngā kaitākaro kia maka ā ringa i ia whare i roto i ngā tāone	Tē āheiĀheiĀhei, hanga oti#Whakaputa utanga a ngā tāone: �Te tatau o te utanga me whakaputaia e ngā whare i roto i ngā tāone, he taurite ki te taupori whānui o te tāone.
Tupuranga pūrua: Ka whakaputa he tāone rahi rearua i te reawhā o ngā kaieke.
Tupuranga rārangi: Ka whakaputa he tāone rahi rearua i te rearua o ngā kaiekePūrua (taketake)Rārangi.Whakatakotoranga rākau i roto i te kēmu: �Tautuhitia te putanga a ngā rākau i roto i te kēmu. Ka pā pea tēnei ki ngā ahumahi e whakawhirinaki ana ki te tupuranga a ngā rākau, hei tauira, ngā mira kani rākauKE tupu, engari kaua e hora atu (ka whakapakarutia ngā mira kani rākau)1E tupu, engari e hora i roto i ngā ngahere anake!E tupu, e hora i ngā wāhi katoaIKaua e tupu, kaua e hora atu (ka whakapakarutia ngā mira kani rākau)"Tauwāhi o te paeutauta matua: 9Te tauwāhi huapae o te paeutauta matua i runga i te mataTauwāhi o te pae tūranga: 5Te tauwāhi huapae o te pae tūranga i raro i te mataPūtoro pakē matapihi: hTe roa i waenganui o ngā matapihi me tīaroaro aunoatia ai te matapihi e neke ana ki ngā matapihi tata	 tongi	Tē āhei"Tatau mōrahi o ngā matapihi: �Te tatau mōrahi o ngā matapihi (ka taea te kati) i mua i te kati aunoa i ngā matapihi tawhito kia whakawātea ai he mokowā mō ētahi matapihi hou	Tē āhei#Kōeke mōrahi mō te topa mai: {Te kōeke mōrahi mō te topa mai i ngā tirohanga. Kia mahara ka whakarahi ngā kōeke teitei ake i ngā herenga pūmahara#Kōeke mōrahi mō te topa atu: qTe kōeke mōrahi mō te topa atu i ngā tirohanga. Ka meinga pea he takaware e ngā kōeke teitei ina whakamahia4x2xMāori2x4x8x"Ata tino arinui hei whakamahi: ��Whakatinaia te ariari mōrahi hei whakamahi mō ngā ata. Ka karoa te whakamahi i te whakairoiro arinui ina wātea hoki. Ka āwhina tēnei kia kotahi te āhua o te kēmu ina whakamahia he ranunga o ngā kōnae newGRF, he arinui, he ariiti hoki4x2x1xTere whakatupu tāone: Tere whakatupu tāoneKorePōturiMāoriTere	Tere rawa)Tatau o ngā tāone nui ki te tāone: CHe nui ake ngā tāone nui i te tīmatanga, ā, he tere ake te tupu
1 i te Kore=Tau whakarea o te rahi o ngā tāone nui i te tīmatanga: WTe rahi toharite o ngā tāone nui ki ngā tāone arowhānui i te tīmatanga o te kēmu$Whakahoutia te kauwhata tuari ia ��Te wā i waenganui o ngā tātai anō i te kauwhata hono. Mō tētahi huānga o te kauwhata ia tātai anō, nō reira, mehemea ka H tēnei tautuhinga, kāore te kauwhata katoa e whakahoutia ia H hēkena, ka whakahoutia te huānga kotahi anake. Ka poto ake te tautuhinga, ka roa ake te wā ka hiahiatia e te pūtukatuka matua kia tātaitia ai. Ka roa ake te tautuhinga, ka roa ake te tōmuri ki te tīmata o te tuari utanga i ngā ara hou4Whakamahia  mō te tātai anō i te kauwhata hono��Te wā i waenganui o ngā tātai anō i te kauwhata hono. I te tīmatanga o tētahi tātai anō, ka hangaia he miro ka mahi mō tēnei tatau o ngā hēkena. Ka poto ake te tautuhinga, ka nui ake te tūponotanga kāore te miro e oti i te wā tika. Kātahi te kēmu ka mutu tae noa ki te ("takaware"). Ka roa atu te tautuhinga, ka roa atu te tōmuri ki te whakahou i te tuari ina panonitia ngā ara!Aratau tuari mō ngā kaieke: �"Hangarite": ka tata ōrite te tatau o ngā kaieke ka haere mai i te teihana A ki te teihana E ki ērā ka haere mai i te teihana E ki te teihana A. "Hikuwaru": ka matapōkere te tatau o ngā kaieke ka haere ki ia ahu. "Ā ringa": kāore he tuari aunoa mō ngā kaiekeAratau tuari mō te mēra: �"Hangarite": ka tata ōrite te tatau o te mēra ka haere mai i te teihana A ki te teihana E ki ērā ka haere mai i te teihana E ki te teihana A. "Hikuwaru": ka matapōkere te tatau o te mēra ka haere ki ia ahu. "Ā ringa": kāore he tuari aunoa mō te mēra2Aratau tuari mō te momo utanga PUKUPUKU RINO: ��Kei roto i te momo utanga PUKUPUKU RINO te tino taonga i te taiao hātai, te taimana i te taiao wera, otirā te kōura i te taiao makariri. Ka taea te panoni tērā e ngā newGRF. "Hangarite": ka tata ōrite te tatau o taua utanga ka haere mai i te teihana A ki te teihana E ki ērā ka haere mai i te teihana E ki te teihana A. "Hikuwaru": ka matapōkere te tatau o taua utanga ka haere ki ia ahu. "Ā ringa": kāore he tuari aunoa mō taua utanga. Me tautuhitia tēnei ki te hikuwaru, te ā ringa rānei ina tākaro i te taiao makariri, te taiao wera rānei, i te mea ka whiwhi utanga anake ngā pēke i aua taiao. Mō te taiao hātai, ka taea te kōwhiri te hangarite i te mea ka tuku taonga ngā pēke ki te pēke taketake*Aratau tuari mō ngā momo utanga kē: s"Hikuwaru": ka matapōkere te tatau o te utanga ka haere ki ia ahu. "Ā ringa": kāore he tuari aunoa mō te utangaĀ ringaHikuwaru	HangariteTika o te tuari: �:Ka nui ake te tautuhinga, ka roa ake te wā ka tātaitia ai te kauwhata hono e te pūtukatuka matua. Mehemea ka roa te wā, ka kite pea koe i te takaware. Heoi anō, mehemea ka tautuhitia ki tētahi uara iti, kāore te tuari e tika, ā, ka kite pea koe kāore te utanga e tukuna ki ngā wāhi e hiahiatia ana e koe%Pānga a te tawhiti ki te popono: ��Mehemea ka tautuhitia tēnei ki tētahi uara neke atu i te 0, ko te tawhiti i waenganui o te teihana taketake A o ētahi utanga me te ūnga E ka pā ki te tatau o te utanga kia tukuna mai i A ki E. Ka tawhiti ake a E i A, ka iti ake te tatau o te utanga ka tukuna. Ka nui ake te tautuhinga, ka iti ake te tatau o te utanga ka tukuna ki ngā teihana tawhiti, otirā ka nui ake te tatau ka tukuna ki ngā teihana tata9Tatau o te utanga e hoki ana mō te aratau hangarite: �Ina iti ake tēnei i te 100%, ka āhua ōrite te tuari hangarite ki te tuari hikuwaru. Ka ouou ake te tatau o te utanga ka hiahiatia ki te tuku whakamuri mehemea ka tukuna tētahi tatau ki tētahi teihana. Ina tautuhitia ki te 0%, ka ōrite pū te tuari hangarite ki te tuari hikuwaruHKohura o ngā ara poto i mua i te whakamahi i ngā ara kītanga nui: �I te maha o ngā wā, ka maha ngā ara i waenganui o te rua teihana. Ka mātua whakakī te hātepe i te ara poto rawa atu, kātahi, ka whakamahia te ara poto tuarua āpānoa kia kohura tērā, ka pērā tonu te hātepe. Ka whakatau tatangia te kohura kia taurite ki te kītanga me te whakamahinga kua whakamaheretia. I te wā kua kohura ngā ara katoa, mehemea ka toe te popono, ka kūkātia ngā ara katoa, e mariu ana ki ngā ara kītanga nui. Engari i te nuinga o te wā, kāore e tika te whakatau tata i te kītanga. Ka tukuna koe kia tautuhi i te ōrau me whakakī ai he ara poto i te haerenga tuatahi i mua i te kōwhiri i tētahi ara roa ake. Tautuhitia ki raro ki te 100% kia karo ai i ngā teihana kōpipiri mehemea kāore i tika te whakatau tata i te kītangaWaeine tere (whenua): Waeine tere (wai): TIna whakaaria he tere i te tāhono kaiwhakamahi, whakaaria i te waeine kua tīpakonaIngarangi (mph)Ngahuru (km/h)SI (m/s)Waeine kēmu (papariki/rā)Waeine kēmu (papariki/hēkona)NotiWaeine kaha waka: cIna whakaaria te kaha o tētahi waka i te tāhono kaiwhakamahi, whakaaria i te waeine kua tīpakonaIngarangi (hp)Ngahuru (hp)SI (kW)Waeine taumaha: WIna whakaaria he taumaha i te tāhono kaiwhakamahi, whakaaria i te waeine kua tīpakonaIngarangi (t/tana poto)Ngahuru (t/tana)SI (kg)Waeine rōrahi: WIna whakaaria he rōrahi i te tāhono kaiwhakamahi, whakaaria i te waeine kua tīpakonaIngarangi (gal)Ngahuru (l)SI (m³)Waeine kaha kumekume: ]Ina whakaaria he kaha kumekume i te tāhono kaiwhakamahi, whakaaria i te waeine kua tīpakonaIngarangi (lbf)Ngahuru (kgf)SI (kN)Waeine teitei: VIna whakaaria he teitei i te tāhono kaiwhakamahi, whakaaria i te waeine kua tīpakonaIngarangi (ft)Ngahuru (m)SI (m)Waeine kēmu (kōeke)Kōwhiringa ā roheWhakairoiroOroTāhonoWhānui	TirohangaHanga#Pitopito kōrero / WhakamōhiotangaUmanga
