 mogleg når det finst køyretøy!Vedlikehald av infrastruktur: �When enabled, infrastructure causes maintenance costs. The cost grows over-proportional with the network size, thus affecting bigger companies more than smaller onesStarting company colour: &Choose starting colour for the company&Starting company secondary colour: SChoose starting secondary colour for the company, if using a NewGRF that enables itFlyplassar utgår aldri: [Enabling this setting makes each airport type stay available forever after its introduction.Advarsel om køyretøyet køyrer seg vill: RTrigger messages about vehicles unable to find a path to their ordered destination%Inspiser ordrane til køyretøya: �When enabled, the orders of the vehicles are periodically checked, and some obvious issues are reported with a news message when detectedNei Ja, men utelat stoppa køyretøyAlle køyretøy5Åtvar dersom eit køyretøy har negativ inntekt: [When enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle has not made any profit within a year]When enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle has not made any profit within a period%Warn if a vehicle is getting old: DWhen enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle is getting oldKøyretøy utgår aldri: RWhen enabled, all vehicle models remain available forever after their introductionTimekeeping: �LSelect the timekeeping units of the game. This cannot be changed later.

Calendar-based is the classic OpenTTD experience, with a year consisting of 12 months, and each month having 28-31 days.

In Wallclock-based time, cargo production and financials are instead based on one-minute increments, which is about as long as a 30 day month takes in Calendar-based mode. These are grouped into 12-minute periods, equivalent to a year in Calendar-based mode.

In either mode there is always a classic calendar, which is used for introduction dates of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructureCalendar	WallclockMinutes per year: �~Choose the number of minutes in a calendar year. The default is 12 minutes. Set to 0 to stop calendar time from changing. Increasing the length of the calendar year slows down the introduction of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructure. It does not affect vehicle speed or economic simulation, except for inflation. This setting is only available when using wallclock timekeeping0 (calendar time frozen) Scale town cargo production: 6Scale the cargo production of towns by this percentage$Scale industry cargo production: ;Scale the cargo production of industries by this percentage%.Autoforny køyretøy når det vert gamalt: sWhen enabled, a vehicle nearing its end of life gets automatically replaced when the renew conditions are fulfilled5Automatisk fornying når køyretøy er  maks alderLRelativ alder for når eit køyretøy skal vurderast for automatisk fornying månad␀␀␀s før månad␀␀␀s etter2Minimum formue for autofornying av køyretøy: ^Minimal amount of money that must remain in the bank before considering auto-renewing vehiclesVarighet for feilmelding: �Duration for displaying error messages in a red window. Note that some (critical) error messages are not closed automatically after this time, but must be closed manuallySyn verktøytips: �Delay before tooltips are displayed when hovering the mouse over some interface element. Alternatively tooltips are bound to the right mouse button when this value is set to 0Hold over i  sekund␀␀␀sHøgreklikk,Syne innbyggjartalet til byane i tittel: 9Syn befolkningstal for byar saman med stadnamn på kartetBredde på linjer i grafar: �Width of the line in the graphs. A thin line is more precisely readable, a thicker line is easier to see and colours are easier to distinguish7Show the NewGRF's name in the build vehicle window: \Add a line