Vseh vozil.Opozori, če je prihodek vozila negativen: gČe je omogočeno, se odpre sporočilo, v kolikor neko vozilo ni ustvarilo dobička v koledarskem letu.]When enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle has not made any profit within a period%Warn if a vehicle is getting old: DWhen enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle is getting oldVozila nikoli ne dotrajajo: BČe je omogočeno, vsi modeli vozil ostanejo omogočeni po uvedbi.Timekeeping: �LSelect the timekeeping units of the game. This cannot be changed later.

Calendar-based is the classic OpenTTD experience, with a year consisting of 12 months, and each month having 28-31 days.

In Wallclock-based time, cargo production and financials are instead based on one-minute increments, which is about as long as a 30 day month takes in Calendar-based mode. These are grouped into 12-minute periods, equivalent to a year in Calendar-based mode.

In either mode there is always a classic calendar, which is used for introduction dates of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructureCalendar	WallclockMinutes per year: �~Choose the number of minutes in a calendar year. The default is 12 minutes. Set to 0 to stop calendar time from changing. Increasing the length of the calendar year slows down the introduction of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructure. It does not affect vehicle speed or economic simulation, except for inflation. This setting is only available when using wallclock timekeeping0 (calendar time frozen) Scale town cargo production: 6Scale the cargo production of towns by this percentage$Scale industry cargo production: ;Scale the cargo production of industries by this percentage%'Samoobnovi vozila, ko se postarajo: cČe je omogočeno, se vozila ob koncu življenjske dobe avtomatsko zamenjajo pod pogoji samoobnove.-Samoobnovi, ko je vozilo  obratovalne dobe8Relativna starost, ko se vozilo upošteva za samoobnovo. mesec␀␀aeev pred mesec␀␀aeev pozneje4Samoobnovi najmanj potrebnega denarja za obnovo: 6Minimalna vsota na banki pred upoštevanjem samoobnove Trajanje poročila o napaki: sTrajanje sporočil o napakah v rdečem kvadratu. Kritična opozorila se ne zaprejo sama po tem času, ampak ročno.Prikaz nasvetov orodij: iČas do prikaza nasvetov orodij, ko je miška na orodju. Lahko se nasvete vidi tudi z desno tipko miške."Zadrži za  sekund␀␀oie
