دائیں second␀␀␀sInfinite money: <Allow unlimited spending and disable bankruptcy of companiesMaximum initial loan: �Maximum amount a company can loan (without taking inflation into account). If set to "No loan", no money will be available unless provided by a Game Script or the "Infinite money" settingNo loanInterest rate: 7Loan interest rate; also controls inflation, if enabledRunning costs: ISet level of maintenance and running costs of vehicles and infrastructureLowMediumHighConstruction speed: 0Limit the amount of construction actions for AIsVehicle breakdowns: ?Control how often inadequately serviced vehicles may break downSubsidy multiplier: /Set how much is paid for subsidised connectionsSubsidy duration: 6Set the number of years for which a subsidy is awarded8Set the number of periods for which a subsidy is awardedNo subsidiesConstruction costs: ,Set level of construction and purchase costsLowMediumHighRecessions: �If enabled, recessions may occur periodically. During a recession all production is significantly lower (it returns to previous level when the recession is over))Disallow train reversing in stations: �If enabled, trains will not reverse in non-terminus stations, even if there is a shorter path to their next destination when reversingDisasters: SToggle disasters which may occasionally block or destroy vehicles or infrastructureLocal authority attitude: �Choose how much noise and environmental damage by companies affect their town rating and further construction actions in the townMap height limit: mSet the maximum height of the map terrain. With "(auto)" a good value will be picked after terrain generation(auto)_You can't set the map height limit to this value. At least one mountain on the map is higherAتعمیرات کے نیچے منظر کشی کی اجازت: BAllow landscaping under buildings and tracks without removing themWکوریج کے علاقے کے حقیقت پسندانہ سائز کی اجازت: SHave differently sized catchment areas for different types of stations and airportsICompany stations can serve industries with attached neutral stations: �OWhen enabled, industries with attached stations (such as Oil Rigs) may also be served by company-owned stations built nearby. When disabled, these industries may only be served by their attached stations. Any nearby company stations won't be able to serve them, nor will the attached station serve anything else other than the industrytشہروں کی ملکیت زیادہ سڑکوں، پلوں اور سرنگوں کو توڑنے کی اجازت: @Make it easier to remove town-owned infrastructure and buildingsEریل گاڑیوں کی زیادہ سے زیادہ لمبائی: Nریل گاڑیوں کی زیادہ سے زیادہ لمبائی طے کریں ٹائل␀␀␀s:گاڑی کے دھوئیں/سپارک کی تعداد: =Set how much smoke or how many sparks are emitted by vehicles;ریل گاڑی کو تیز کرنے والا ماڈل: ��Select the physics model for train acceleration. The "original" model penalises slopes equally for all vehicles. The "realistic" model penalises slopes and curves depending on various properties of the consist, like length and tractive effort0گاڑی کو تیز کرنے کا ماڈل: ��Select the physics model for road vehicle acceleration. The "original" model penalises slopes equally for all vehicles. The "realistic" model penalises slopes depending on various properties of the engine, for example 'tractive effort'Slope steepness for trains: \Steepness of a sloped tile for a train. Higher values make it more difficult to climb a hill%&Slope steepness for road vehicles: cSteepness of a sloped tile for a road vehicle. Higher values make it more difficult to climb a hillXریل گاڑیوں اور بحری جہازوں کو 90° مڑنے سے روکیں: ��90 degree turns occur when a horizontal track is directly followed by a vertical track piece on the adjacent tile, thus making the train turn by 90 degree when traversing the tile edge instead of the usual 45 degrees for other track combinations5اسٹیشنوں کو جوڑنے کی اجازت: zAllow adding parts to a station without directly touching the existing parts, by Ctrl+Clicking while placing the new partsافراط زر: UEnable inflation in the economy, where costs are slightly faster rising than payments6پل کی زیادہ سے زیادہ لمبائی: <پل بنانے کی زیادہ سے زیادہ لمبائیMaximum bridge height: #Maximum height for building bridges:سرنگ کی زیادہ سے زیادہ لمبائی: Dسرنگیں بنانے کی زیادہ سے زیادہ لمبائیEخود بنیادی صنعت تعمیر کرنے کا طریقہ: �EMethod of funding a primary industry. 'none' means it is not possible to fund any, 'prospecting' means funding is possible, but construction occurs in a random spot on the map and may as well fail, 'as other industries' means raw industries can be constructed by companies like processing industries in any position they likeکوئی نہیں#دوسری صنعتوں کی طرحتوقعات<کارخانوں کے آس پاس ہموار علاقہ: �Amount of flat space around an industry. This ensures empty space will remain available around an industry for building tracks, et ceterahایک شہر میں ایک جیسی ایک سے زیادہ صنعتیں لگانے کی اجازت: �Normally, a town does not want more than one industry of each type. With this setting, it will allow several industries of the same type in the same town(ریل کے اشارے دکھائو: 2Select on which side of the track to place signalsOn the leftOn the driving sideOn the rightIہر سال کے آخر پر کھاتے والی ونڈو دکھاو: 2Show finances window at the end of the period: If enabled, the finances window pops up at the end of each year to allow easy inspection of the financial status of the company�If enabled, the finances window pops up at the end of each period to allow easy inspection of the financial status of the companyCنئے احکامات شروع سے 'نان اسٹاپ' ہوں: �9Normally, a vehicle will stop at every station it passes. By enabling this setting, it will drive through all station on the way to its final destination without stopping. Note, that this setting only defines a default value for new orders. Individual orders can be set explicitly to either behaviour neverthelessUنئے احکامات شروع سے  کے پلیٹ فارم پر اسٹاپ ہوں�_Place where a train will stop at the platform by default. The 'near end' means close to the entry point, 'middle' means in the middle of the platform, and 'far end' means far away from the entry point. Note, that this setting only defines a default value for new orders. Individual orders can have their stop location set by clicking on the order textشروع میںدرمیان میںآخر میںCونڈو کو پین کرو جب ماؤس کنارے پر ہو: ZWhen enabled, viewports will start to scroll when the mouse is near the edge of the windowDisabledMain viewport, full-screen onlyMain viewportEvery viewportCمقامی اتھارٹی کی رشوت کی اجازت دیں: �Allow companies to try bribing the local town authority. If the bribe is noticed by an inspector, the company will not be able to act in the town for six months�Allow companies to try bribing the local town authority. If the bribe is noticed by an inspector, the company will not be able to act in the town for six minutesPخصوصی نقل و حمل کے حقوق کو خریدنے کی اجازت: �If a company buys exclusive transport rights for a town, opponents' stations (passenger and cargo) won't receive any cargo for twelve months�If a company buys exclusive transport rights for a town, opponents' stations (passenger and cargo) won't receive any cargo for twelve minutes.فنڈنگ عمارتوں کی اجازت: =Allow companies to give money to towns for funding new housesJمقامی سڑکوں کی تعمیر نو فنڈنگ کی اجازت: kAllow companies to give money to towns for road re-construction to sabotage road-based services in the townIدوسری کمپنیوں کو پیسے بھیجنے کی اجازت: =Allow transfer of money between companies in multiplayer modeTمال گاڑیوں کو وزنی دکھانے کے لئے وزن کا ضارب: �Set the impact of carrying freight in trains. A higher value makes carrying freight more demanding for trains, especially at hillsPlane speed factor: ySet the relative speed of planes compared to other vehicle types, to reduce the amount of income of transport by aircraft1 / >ہوائی جہازوں کے حادثوں کی تعداد: �Set the chance of a random aircraft crash happening.
