نارملCAllow level crossings with roads or rails owned by competitors: LAllow construction of level crossings on roads or rails owned by competitorscشہر کی ملکیت سڑکوں پر ڈرائیو تھرو اڈے بنانے کی اجازت: FAllow construction of drive-through road stops on roads owned by townspمد مقابلوں کی ملکیت سڑکوں پر ڈرائیو تھرو اڈے بنانے کی اجازت: PAllow construction of drive-through road stops on roads owned by other companiesXجب گاڑیاں موجود ہوں تو یہ سیٹنگ بدلنا ممکن نہیں+انفراسٹرکچر کی بحالی: �When enabled, infrastructure causes maintenance costs. The cost grows over-proportional with the network size, thus affecting bigger companies more than smaller onesStarting company colour: &Choose starting colour for the company&Starting company secondary colour: SChoose starting secondary colour for the company, if using a NewGRF that enables itBہوائی اڈوں کی معیاد کبھی ختم نہ ہو: [Enabling this setting makes each airport type stay available forever after its introductionAاگر گاڑی کھو جاے تو انتباہ کیجئیے: RTrigger messages about vehicles unable to find a path to their ordered destination<گاڑیوں کے احکامات کا جائزہ لیں: �When enabled, the orders of the vehicles are periodically checked, and some obvious issues are reported with a news message when detectedنہیں9ہاں، لیکن رُکی ہوئی گاڑیاں نہیںتمام گاڑیوں کےLگاڑی کو نقصان کی صورت میں انتباہ کیجئیے: [When enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle has not made any profit within a year]When enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle has not made any profit within a period%Warn if a vehicle is getting old: DWhen enabled, a news message gets sent when a vehicle is getting old;گاڑیوں کی معیاد کبھی ختم نہ ہو: RWhen enabled, all vehicle models remain available forever after their introductionTimekeeping: �LSelect the timekeeping units of the game. This cannot be changed later.

Calendar-based is the classic OpenTTD experience, with a year consisting of 12 months, and each month having 28-31 days.

In Wallclock-based time, cargo production and financials are instead based on one-minute increments, which is about as long as a 30 day month takes in Calendar-based mode. These are grouped into 12-minute periods, equivalent to a year in Calendar-based mode.

In either mode there is always a classic calendar, which is used for introduction dates of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructureCalendar	WallclockMinutes per year: �~Choose the number of minutes in a calendar year. The default is 12 minutes. Set to 0 to stop calendar time from changing. Increasing the length of the calendar year slows down the introduction of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructure. It does not affect vehicle speed or economic simulation, except for inflation. This setting is only available when using wallclock timekeeping0 (calendar time frozen) Scale town cargo production: 6Scale the cargo production of towns by this percentage$Scale industry cargo production: ;Scale the cargo production of industries by this percentage%aگاڑی پرانی ہونے کی صورت میں خودکار طریقے سے بدل دیں: sWhen enabled, a vehicle nearing its end of life gets automatically replaced when the renew conditions are fulfilleddگاڑی کی زیادہ سے زیادہ عمر  ہونے پر خودکار تجدید کریں۔rمتعلقہ عمر جب کسی گاڑی کو خودکار تجدید کے لیے سمجھا جانا چاہیے۔ ماہ پہلے ماہ بعد{خودکار تبدیلی کے لئے ضروری کم سے کم رقم کو خودکار طریقے سے بدل دیں: �گاڑیوں کی خودکار تجدید کرنے پر غور کرنے سے پہلے کم سے کم رقم جو بینک میں رہنی چاہیے۔Duration of error message: �Duration for displaying error messages in a red window. Note that some (critical) error messages are not closed automatically after this time, but must be closed manuallyShow tooltips: �Delay before tooltips are displayed when hovering the mouse over some interface element. Alternatively tooltips are bound to the right mouse button when this value is set to 0"Hover for  millisecond␀␀␀sRight clickKشہر کی آبادی شہر کے نام کے ساتھ دکھائیں: 9Display the population of towns in their label on the map5مخطط میں لائینوں کی موٹائی: �Width of the line in the graphs. A thin line is more precisely readable, a thicker line is easier to see and colours are easier to distinguish7Show the NewGRF's name in the build vehicle window: \Add a line to the build vehicle window, showing which NewGRF the selected vehicle comes from@Show the cargoes the vehicles can carry in the list windows: VIf enabled, the vehicle's transportable load will appear above it in the vehicle listsLandscape: �Landscapes define basic gameplay scenarios with different cargoes and town growth requirements. NewGRF and Game Scripts allow finer control though!زمین بنانے والا: �The original generator depends on the base graphics set, and composes fixed landscape shapes. TerraGenesis is a Perlin noise based generator with finer control settingsاصلیTerraGenesisTerrain type: 9Choose the height of hills and mountains of the landscapeIndustry density: _Set how many industries should be generated and what level should be maintained during the game2Maximum distance from edge for Oil industries: �تیل کے کارخانے صرف نقسے کی حدود کے قریب بنتے ہیں، جزیرہ والے نقشوں کیلئے یہ ساحل پر ہےبرف کی اونچائی: ��Choose at what height snow starts in sub-arctic landscape. Snow also affects industry generation and town growth requirements. Can only be modified via Scenario Editor or is otherwise calculated via "snow coverage"Snow coverage: ��Choose the approximate amount of snow on the sub-arctic landscape. Snow also affects industry generation and town growth requirements. Only used during map generation. Sea level and coast tiles never have snow%Desert coverage: �Choose the approximate amount of desert on the tropical landscape. Desert also affects industry generation and town growth requirements. Only used during map generation%=علاقے کی کٹائی (صرف TerraGenesis میں) : �Choose the shape and number of hills. Smooth landscapes have fewer, wider hills, while rough landscapes have more, smaller hillsبہت ہموار
