 limit (as fast as your computer allows). Values below 100% slow the game down. The upper-limit depends on the specification of your computer and can vary depending on the game% normal game speed*No limit (as fast as your computer allows)News ticker: 'Play sound for summarised news messagesNewspaper: %Play sound upon display of newspapersEnd of year: End of period: sPlay sound at the end of a year summarising the company's performance during the year compared to the previous yearyPlay sound at the end of a period summarising the company's performance during the period compared to the previous periodConstruction: 7Play sound on successful constructions or other actionsButton clicks: Beep when clicking buttonsDisasters/accidents: -Play sound effects of accidents and disastersVehicles: Play sound effects of vehiclesAmbient: وسیع آواز چلایںCکمپنی کی زیادہ سے زیادہ ریل گاڑیاں: 0Maximum number of trains that a company can have<کمپنی کی زیادہ سے زیادہ گاڑیاں: 7Maximum number of road vehicles that a company can haveCکمپنی کے زیادہ سے زیادہ ہوائی جہاز: 2Maximum number of aircraft that a company can haveAکمپنی کے زیادہ سے زیادہ بحری جہاز: /Maximum number of ships that a company can haveLکمپیوٹر کے لئے ریل گاڑیاں غیر فعال کریں: LEnabling this setting makes building trains impossible for a computer playerEکمپیوٹر کے لئے گاڑیاں غیر فعال کریں: SEnabling this setting makes building road vehicles impossible for a computer playerLکمپیوٹر کے لئے ہوائی جہاز غیر فعال کریں: NEnabling this setting makes building aircraft impossible for a computer playerJکمپیوٹر کے لئے بحری جہاز غیر فعال کریں: KEnabling this setting makes building ships impossible for a computer playerSزیادہ کھلاڑیوں والے کھیل میں AI کی اجازت دیں: =Allow AI computer players to participate in multiplayer gamesAاسکرپٹس کے معطل ہونے سے پہلے #opcodes: FMaximum number of computation steps that a script can take in one turn Max memory usage per script: yHow much memory a single script may consume before it's forcibly terminated. This may need to be increased for large maps MiB/مرمتی وقفے فیصد میں ہیں: �When enabled, vehicles try to service when their reliability drops by a given percentage of the maximum reliability.

For example, if a vehicle's maximum reliability is 90% and the service interval is 20%, the vehicle will try to service when it reaches 72% reliability(Default service interval for trains: nSet the default service interval for new rail vehicles, if no explicit service interval is set for the vehicle/Default service interval for road vehicles: nSet the default service interval for new road vehicles, if no explicit service interval is set for the vehicleDہوائی جہاز کے لیے طے شدہ مرمتی وقفہ: ��اگر گاڑی کے لیے کوئی واضح مرمتی وقفہ مقرر نہیں کیا گیا ہے تو نئے ہوائی جہاز کے لیے پہلے سے طے شدہ مرمتی وقفہ مقرر کریں'Default service interval for ships: fSet the default service interval for new ships, if no explicit service interval is set for the vehicle Day␀␀␀s Minute␀␀␀s %غیر فعال{گاڑیوں کی خرابی غیر فعال ہونے کی صورت میں مرمت بھی غیر فعال کر دیں: DWhen enabled, vehicles do not get serviced if they cannot break downFLoading speed penalty for trains that are longer than the station: �When enabled, trains which are too long for the station load more slowly than a train which fits the station. This setting does not affect pathfinding;مال گاڑی کی حد رفتار فعال کریں: WWhen enabled, also use speed limits of wagons for deciding the maximum speed of a train@الیلٹرک ریل گاڑیاں غیر فعال کریں: gEnabling this setting disables the requirement to electrify tracks to make electric engines run on themFکھلاڑی کے اسٹیشن پر پہلی گاڑی کی آمد: LDisplay a newspaper when the first vehicle arrives at a new player's stationDمقابل کے اسٹیشن پر پہلی گاڑی کی آمد: PDisplay a newspaper when the first vehicle arrives at a new competitor's station حادثے / تباہیاں: 5Display a newspaper when accidents or disasters occur'Accidents of competitor's vehicles: :Display a newspaper about crashed vehicles for competitors#کمپنی کی معلومات: XDisplay a newspaper when a new company starts, or when companies are risking to bankrupt#صنعتوں کا افتتاح: ,Display a newspaper when new industries openصنعتوں کی بندش: .Display a newspaper when industries close downمعیشت بدل گئی: 3Display a newspaper about global changes to economyoکمپنی کی خدمات حاصل کرنے والی صنعتوں کی پیداوار میں تبدیلی: cDisplay a newspaper when the production level of industries change, which are served by the companyqمُقابل کی خدمات حاصل کرنے والی صنعتوں کی پیداوار میں تبدیلی: gDisplay a newspaper when the production level of industries change, which are served by the competitors@دوسری صنعت کی پیداوار میں تبدیلی: vDisplay a newspaper when the production level of industries change, which are not served by the company or competitorsRکمپنی کی گاڑیوں کے بارے پیں نصیحت / معلومات: 1Display messages about vehicles needing attentionنئی گاڑیاں: =Display a newspaper when a new vehicle type becomes available5کارگو کی منظوری میں تبدیلی: CDisplay messages about stations changing acceptance of some cargoesامداد: 0Display a newspaper about subsidy related eventsعمومی معلومات: nDisplay newspaper about general events, such as purchase of exclusive rights or funding of road reconstructionبند
